        "id": 1985170
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-29T18:36:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the decoder alarm is stopped, the cleanup ensure queue is emptied as well. Since, the call takes a lock and the contant FRAME_COUNT is less than MAX_SIZE, this would never happen as quque is cleared when the decoder alarm is stopped/cleared out.",
